        <mxCell id="note" value="Deliberately left out: internal Council finance/HR systems, the legacy 2009 system (migrated from, not integrated with), and any system used only for the author's own tooling. This diagram shows who Takarda talks to at run time, not everyone the Council operates." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
